          {
            "title": "Within a range",
            "id": 91465,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare una condizione per selezionare gli elementi che hanno una proprietà all'interno di un intervallo, come i film con un <code>rating</code> compreso tra <code>9</code> e <code>10</code>.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE movies (&#xA;title varchar(255),&#xA;rating numeric (1,1)&#xA;);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO movies (title, rating)&#xA;VALUES ('The Godfather', 9.2);&#xA;INSERT INTO movies (title, rating)&#xA;VALUES ('The Matrix', 8.7);&#xA;INSERT INTO movies (title, rating)&#xA;VALUES ('La Strada', 8);&#xA;INSERT INTO movies (title, rating)&#xA;VALUES ('The Dark Knight', 9);\"><tables><table name=\"movies\"><row><header content=\"title\" /><header content=\"rating\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Godfather\" /><data content=\"9.2\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Matrix\" /><data content=\"8.7\" /></row><row><data content=\"La Strada\" /><data content=\"8\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Dark Knight\" /><data content=\"9\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" *\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" movies\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" rating \" /><text value=\"BETWEEN\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"AND\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"WHERE rating BETWEEN 10 AND 20\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"title\" /><header content=\"rating\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Godfather\" /><data content=\"9.2\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Dark Knight\" /><data content=\"9\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>WHERE rating BETWEEN 9 AND 10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Condition",
            "id": 91467,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando scriviamo la condizione, iniziamo con la colonna di cui stiamo controllando i valori, come <code>rating</code> in questo caso.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE movies (&#xA;title varchar(255),&#xA;rating numeric (1,1)&#xA;);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO movies (title, rating)&#xA;VALUES ('The Godfather', 9.2);&#xA;INSERT INTO movies (title, rating)&#xA;VALUES ('The Matrix', 8.7);&#xA;INSERT INTO movies (title, rating)&#xA;VALUES ('La Strada', 8);&#xA;INSERT INTO movies (title, rating)&#xA;VALUES ('The Dark Knight', 9);\"><tables><table name=\"movies\"><row><header content=\"title\" /><header content=\"rating\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Godfather\" /><data content=\"9.2\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Matrix\" /><data content=\"8.7\" /></row><row><data content=\"La Strada\" /><data content=\"8\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Dark Knight\" /><data content=\"9\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" *\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" movies\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" rating \" /><text value=\"BETWEEN\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"AND\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"33\" /></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"title\" /><header content=\"rating\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Godfather\" /><data content=\"9.2\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Dark Knight\" /><data content=\"9\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>rating</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "The keyword BETWEEN",
            "id": 91469,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per verificare se un valore rientra in un intervallo, usiamo la parola chiave <code>BETWEEN</code> seguita da un intervallo di valori.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE movies (&#xA;title varchar(255),&#xA;rating numeric (1,1)&#xA;);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO movies (title, rating)&#xA;VALUES ('The Godfather', 9.2);&#xA;INSERT INTO movies (title, rating)&#xA;VALUES ('The Matrix', 8.7);&#xA;INSERT INTO movies (title, rating)&#xA;VALUES ('La Strada', 8);&#xA;INSERT INTO movies (title, rating)&#xA;VALUES ('The Dark Knight', 9);\"><tables><table name=\"movies\"><row><header content=\"title\" /><header content=\"rating\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Godfather\" /><data content=\"9.2\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Matrix\" /><data content=\"8.7\" /></row><row><data content=\"La Strada\" /><data content=\"8\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Dark Knight\" /><data content=\"9\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" *\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" movies\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" rating \" /><text value=\"BETWEEN\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"AND\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"50\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"title\" /><header content=\"rating\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Godfather\" /><data content=\"9.2\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Dark Knight\" /><data content=\"9\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>BETWEEN</code>, seguito da <code>9 AND 10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Defining a range",
            "id": 91470,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Impostiamo l'inizio dell'intervallo, ad esempio <code>9</code>, e la fine dell'intervallo, ad esempio <code>10</code>, separati dalla parola chiave <code>AND</code>.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE movies (&#xA;title varchar(255),&#xA;rating numeric (1,1)&#xA;);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO movies (title, rating)&#xA;VALUES ('The Godfather', 9.2);&#xA;INSERT INTO movies (title, rating)&#xA;VALUES ('The Matrix', 8.7);&#xA;INSERT INTO movies (title, rating)&#xA;VALUES ('La Strada', 8);&#xA;INSERT INTO movies (title, rating)&#xA;VALUES ('The Dark Knight', 9);\"><tables><table name=\"movies\"><row><header content=\"title\" /><header content=\"rating\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Godfather\" /><data content=\"9.2\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Matrix\" /><data content=\"8.7\" /></row><row><data content=\"La Strada\" /><data content=\"8\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Dark Knight\" /><data content=\"9\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" *\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" movies\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" rating \" /><text value=\"BETWEEN\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"AND\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"50\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"title\" /><header content=\"rating\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Godfather\" /><data content=\"9.2\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Dark Knight\" /><data content=\"9\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>9</code>, seguito da <code>AND</code> e infine <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Border inclusive",
            "id": 91471,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gli intervalli includono i loro estremi. Con un intervallo come <code>BETWEEN 8 AND 9</code> selezioniamo i film con valutazione 8 e 9, e tutti quelli intermedi.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE movies (&#xA;title varchar(255),&#xA;rating numeric (1,1)&#xA;);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO movies (title, rating)&#xA;VALUES ('The Godfather', 9.2);&#xA;INSERT INTO movies (title, rating)&#xA;VALUES ('The Matrix', 8.7);&#xA;INSERT INTO movies (title, rating)&#xA;VALUES ('La Strada', 8);&#xA;INSERT INTO movies (title, rating)&#xA;VALUES ('The Dark Knight', 9);\"><tables><table name=\"movies\"><row><header content=\"title\" /><header content=\"rating\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Godfather\" /><data content=\"9.2\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Matrix\" /><data content=\"8.7\" /></row><row><data content=\"La Strada\" /><data content=\"8\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Dark Knight\" /><data content=\"9\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" *\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" movies\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" rating \" /><text value=\"BETWEEN\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"AND\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"title\" /><header content=\"rating\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Matrix\" /><data content=\"8.7\" /></row><row><data content=\"La Strada\" /><data content=\"8\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Dark Knight\" /><data content=\"9\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>BETWEEN</code>, seguito da <code>8</code> e poi <code>AND</code>, <code>9</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Within a range",
            "id": 93205,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale condizione verifica se una proprietà <code>age</code> è compresa tra due numeri, come <code>10</code> e <code>20</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>age BETWEEN 10 AND 20</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>age &lt;= 20</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>age BETWEEN 10 AND 20</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa <code>column BETWEEN lower AND upper</code> per verificare un intervallo. L'intervallo include entrambi gli estremi.</p><p>Ti servono pazienti con almeno <code>10</code> anni e al massimo <code>20</code>. Quale condizione funziona?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>age BETWEEN 10 AND 20</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>age &lt;= 20</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>age BETWEEN 20 AND 10</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>age BETWEEN 10 AND 20</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Condition",
            "id": 93206,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa c'è che non va in questa query?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" patients\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"BETWEEN\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"AND\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dopo <code>WHERE</code> dovrebbe esserci un nome di colonna</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non c'è nulla di sbagliato nella query</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dopo <code>WHERE</code> dovrebbe esserci un nome di colonna.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vuoi pazienti di età compresa tra <code>10</code> e <code>20</code>. Quale modifica fa verificare <code>age</code> alla query?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" patients\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"BETWEEN\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"AND\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Aggiungi <code>age</code> subito dopo <code>WHERE</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sostituisci <code>WHERE</code> con <code>age</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Aggiungi <code>age</code> subito dopo <code>AND</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Aggiungi <code>age</code> subito dopo <code>WHERE</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: The keyword BETWEEN",
            "id": 93207,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale parola chiave usiamo per verificare se una proprietà numerica rientra in un intervallo?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>BETWEEN</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>ORDER BY</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>BETWEEN</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usi <code>BETWEEN</code> per tenere solo i pazienti tra <code>10</code> e <code>20</code> anni. Quale parte della query lo richiede?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">La condizione dopo <code>WHERE</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Il nome della tabella dopo <code>FROM</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Le colonne elencate dopo <code>SELECT</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere La condizione dopo <code>WHERE</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Defining a range",
            "id": 93208,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale parola chiave usiamo per definire un intervallo?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>AND</code>, come in <code>BETWEEN 10 AND 20</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non ci serve una parola chiave: possiamo semplicemente scrivere numeri come in <code>BETWEEN 10 20</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>AND</code>, come in <code>BETWEEN 10 AND 20</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hai scritto <code>age BETWEEN 10 AND 10</code>. Mantieni l'estremo inferiore ed estendi l'intervallo fino all'età di <code>20</code> anni.</p><p>Quale modifica funziona?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Cambia in <code>20</code> il numero dopo <code>AND</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Cambia in <code>20</code> il numero prima di <code>AND</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Sostituisci <code>AND</code> con <code>OR</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Cambia in <code>20</code> il numero dopo <code>AND</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
