            "id": 93209,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quali valori di <code>age</code> selezionerà questa query?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" patients\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age \" /><text value=\"BETWEEN\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"AND\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Valori compresi tra <code>30</code> e <code>60</code>, inclusi <code>30</code> e <code>60</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Valori tra <code>30</code> e <code>60</code>, ma non <code>30</code> e <code>60</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Valori compresi tra <code>30</code> e <code>60</code>, inclusi <code>30</code> e <code>60</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cambi l'estremo inferiore da <code>30</code> a <code>31</code>. Quale età corrisponde alla query mostrata, ma non a quella modificata?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" patients\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age \" /><text value=\"BETWEEN\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"AND\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>30</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>60</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>45</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>30</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
